        "original_id": "e07e7632-697c-5a56-a0f0-d832e16da1f4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Likwit Crew\n- People: Xzibit, Defari, Alvin Nathaniel Joiner, Phil Da Agony, Lootpack, Styliztik Jones, Declaime, J. Wells\n- Groups: The Barbershop MC's\n- Products: Street Music\n- Topics: West Coast hip hop, Pimp My Ride\n\nFacts:\n- The Likwit Crew is a West Coast hip hop collective.\n- Other artists who joined the Likwit Crew include Xzibit, Phil Da Agony, Lootpack, Defari, Styliztik Jones, Declaime, J. Wells, and The Barbershop MC's.\n- Alvin Nathaniel Joiner, born on September 18, 1974, is better known by the stage name Xzibit.\n- Xzibit is an American rapper, actor, television host, radio personality, and record producer.\n- Xzibit is known as the host of the MTV show Pimp My Ride, which brought him mainstream success.\n- Street Music is the third album by Defari.\n- Defari is an American hip hop musician and a member of the Likwit Crew.",
